OL,3,C'Avoid the area' - warning as large
OL,4,Cfire breaks out on Devon grassland
OL,6,FA large fire has broken out across 50
OL,7,Facres of land at Micinglake Valley
OL,8,FPark in Exeter.
OL,10,FFirefighters are still tackling the
OL,11,Fflames this morning, but a fire
OL,12,Fservice spokesperson has said that it
OL,13,Fis safe for anyone who had left a
OL,14,Fproperty in the area to return.
OL,16,FFire crews were called to the scene at
OL,17,Fabout 4.55pm on 11 August and more
OL,18,Fthan 20 fire engines atteneded.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
