OL,3,C'Avoid the area' - warning as large
OL,4,Cfire breaks out on Devon grassland
OL,6,F"The fire is now contained within the
OL,7,Farea of Mincinglake Valley, so please
OL,8,Fcontinue to avoid the affected area",
OL,9,Fa spokesperson from Devon and Somerset
OL,10,FFire and Rescue said.
OL,12,F"However, it is now safe for anyone
OL,13,Fwho has left a property in the area to
OL,14,Freturn.
OL,16,F"The fire has affected an area of
OL,17,Fabout 50 acres and we had 20 fire
OL,18,Fengines as well as a number of
OL,19,Fspecialist vehicles at its peak.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
