PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786538913
OL,3,C'Avoid the area' - warning as large
OL,4,Cfire breaks out on Devon grassland
OL,6,F"Please stay away from the area to let
OL,7,Four crews work safely to bring the
OL,8,Ffire under control.
OL,10,F"Due to the amount of smoke in the
OL,11,Fair, local residents are also advised
OL,12,Fto keep their windows and doors
OL,13,Fclosed."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
